<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson, Saab Aircraft in JV.</title>
<headline>Ericsson, Saab Aircraft in JV.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms firm LM Ericsson AB said on Thursday its Ericsson Microwave System division would form a joint venture with Saab Aircraft on military aircraft technology.</p>
</text>
